<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>AutoBiz AI</title>

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #f4f7fb;
      color: #172033;
    }

    header {
      background: #172033;
      color: white;
      padding: 22px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    header h1 {
      font-size: 30px;
    }

    header p {
      margin-top: 6px;
      opacity: 0.8;
    }

    .hero {
      background: white;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 60px 20px;
    }

    .hero h2 {
      font-size: 36px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .hero p {
      max-width: 650px;
      margin: auto;
      line-height: 1.6;
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 28px;
      padding: 16px 28px;
      background: #172033;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .features {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 40px 20px;
    }

    .features h2 {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    .card {
      background: white;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      padding: 25px;
      border-radius: 15px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
    }

    .card h3 {
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .card p {
      color: #555;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    footer {
      background: #172033;
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 30px;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
  <h1>AutoBiz AI</h1>
  <p>Created by Owami Maziya</p>
</header>

<section class="hero">

  <h2>Let AI Handle the Busy Work.</h2>

  <p>
    AutoBiz AI helps small businesses automate customer
    communication, leads, appointments, quotes and follow-ups.
  </p>

  <a href="#" class="button">Start Automating</a>

</section>

<section class="features">

  <h2>What AutoBiz AI Does</h2>

  <div class="card">
    <h3>🤖 AI Business Assistant</h3>
    <p>
      Organize repetitive business tasks and help owners
      respond to customers faster.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h3>👥 Lead Management</h3>
    <p>
      Keep track of potential customers and follow-ups.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h3>💬 Customer Messages</h3>
    <p>
      Organize incoming customer questions and requests.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h3>📅 Appointments</h3>
    <p>
      Keep business appointments organized in one place.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h3>🧾 Quote Assistant</h3>
    <p>
      Create draft quotations from information provided by
      the business owner.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h3>📊 Business Dashboard</h3>
    <p>
      See leads, appointments and business activity
      from one simple dashboard.
    </p>
  </div>

</section>

<footer>
  <p>AutoBiz AI © 2026</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
